Stop every PBT chain.

The chain step checks `git cat-file -e origin/main:games/the-game/ai/eval/STOP_TRAINING`
before dispatching the next leg. While this file exists on main, no leg
dispatches a successor, so the 35 fan-out variants wind down as each
in-flight leg finishes. Deleting it lets them continue.

Stopped to change when FORCED fires. The danger trigger requires a panel
already in the top row with the banked clock below the escape floor, which
is not an early warning; until then BUILD refuses the bare threes that
would lower the stack. Changing that changes how the bot plays, and the
mode logic is not in the island fingerprint, so the populations would not
restart on their own — they would carry on fitted to a bot that no longer
exists.
